-intel":"2.206","mac-arm":"2.206","ios":null},"status":"accepted","created_at":null,"updated_at":null}],"tags":["interface"],"about":"# Inputs Viewer\r\n\r\nShows player inputs during gameplay. Configure in the pause menu.\r\n\r\nThis mod is inspired by the Key Viewer feature in <cy>ADOFAI Tweaks</c> (a mod for <cj>A Dance of</c> <cr>Fire</c> <cj>and Ice</c>).\r\n\r\nUntested on MacOS and Android","changelog":"# v1.4.1\r\n\r\n- Changed how inputs are detected\r\n\r\n# v1.4.0\r\n\r\n- Added a \"Reset 'Total Inputs' on Each Attempt\" setting\r\n- Adjusted CPS calculation so that it accounts for TimeWarp triggers\r\n\r\n# v1.3.2\r\n\r\n- Ported to 2.2081\r\n\r\n# v1.3.1\r\n\r\n- Android version from someone's request\r\n\r\n# v1.3.0\r\n\r\n- You can now access display settings in the mod \r\n- Add a setting to disable the button in the pause menu\r\n\r\n# v1.2.2\r\n\r\n- Port to 2.2074\r\n\r\n# v1.2.1\r\n\r\n- Fixed a crash when entering a level without level data\r\n- Added categories to mod settings\r\n\r\n# v1.2.0\r\n\r\n- Added <cy>CPS Calculation</c> to mod settings\r\n- Separated input settings to Classic and Platformer\r\n- Changed <cy>Hide L&R Buttons in Non-Platformer</c> to <cy>Hide L&R Keys</c> because of the above feature\r\n\r\n# v1.1.0\r\n\r\n- Fixed key display staying pressed when pausing the game\r\n- Default keys positions are now based on your aspect ratio\r\n- Added reset positions button\r\n- Added <cy>Hide L&R Buttons in Non-Platformer</c>\r\n- Added <cy>Show Clicks per Seconds</c>\r\n\r\n# v1.0.1\r\n\r\nInitial release","created_at":"2024-08-02T06:59:23Z","updated_at":"2026-05-04T08:29:22Z","links":{"community":null,"homepage":null,"source":"https://github.com/Khronophobia/Inputs-Viewer"}}